title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: Virus Quarantine
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the size (mail count and estimated disk usage) of the virus
 quarantine via {/quarantine/virusstatus}. Since a healthy mail flow
 should rarely quarantine actual viruses, the default thresholds
 already WARN/CRIT at a low count (default: 1) so that any virus
 catch is noticed promptly.

item:
 None, one service per host.

discovery:
 One service is created if virus quarantine status is available from
 the API.
